[{"q":"Choose the correct spelling.","o":["Inormous","Inermus","Enormus","Enormous"],"a":3,"id":"q4f4ebdc836","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"Choose the correct spelling-","o":["Asylum","Asylam","Assylum","Assylam"],"a":0,"e":"","id":"q4fca1dccd4","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"Which word has no spelling error?","o":["Renounciation","Tigeress","Reminiscance","Renaissance"],"a":3,"e":"","id":"q501badab59","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"Which of the following is correctly spelled?","o":["Pranunciation","Pronounciacion","Pronunciation","Pronounciation"],"a":2,"e":"","id":"q50658aca9f","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"Which one is the correct spelling?","o":["Amelyorate","Amoliorate","Ameliorat","Ameliorate"],"a":3,"e":"","id":"q5083e520c9","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"Which one is incorrect?","o":["Bourgeoise","Blaspheme","Bureaucracy","Baptism"],"a":0,"e":"Bourgeoise বানান ভুল। শুদ্ধ রূপ bourgeois (ব্যক্তি/বিশেষণ) অথবা bourgeoisie (শ্রেণি)। বাকি তিনটি শুদ্ধ: Blaspheme (ধর্মনিন্দা করা), Bureaucracy (আমলাতন্ত্র) এবং Baptism (খ্রিস্টীয় দীক্ষাস্নান)। এখানে শেষের -se বানানের ভুল। bourgeois-এ শেষে s আছে, আর bourgeoisie-তে -sie। Blaspheme-এ ph আছে, আর Baptism-এ p ও t আছে।","id":"q5093edbda9","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"Choose the correct spelling.","o":["Veterinary","Vetarinary","Veterinarry","Veteninary"],"a":0,"e":"","id":"q52361f69af","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"Find the correctly spelt word.","o":["Recontciliation","Reconcilliation","Reconcilaition","Reconciliation","None of them"],"a":3,"e":"","id":"q5243dee0a5","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"Choose the incorrect spelling.","o":["Cemetery","Conscientious","Sacrilegious","Naouseous"],"a":3,"e":"","id":"q52c97c442c","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"Which one is correctly spelt?","o":["Anihilate","Annehillate","Annihellate","Annihilate"],"a":3,"e":"","id":"q5346420f7e","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"Which one is not correctly spelled?","o":["Exaggerations","Hierarchy","Inconveniently","Commenserately"],"a":3,"e":"Commenserately ভুল বানান; শুদ্ধ রূপ Commensurately। এটি adverb, অর্থ কোনো কিছুর তুলনায় পরিমাণে